    <div class="idc-modal idc-details-modal"><section class="idc-modal-side"><header class="idc-modal-head"><div><span class="idc-modal-kicker">Student record</span><h3 id="idcModalTitle">Student details</h3></div><button type="button" class="idc-close" id="idcClose" aria-label="Close student details"><i class="fas fa-times"></i></button></header><div class="idc-preview-info" id="idcPreviewInfo"></div><div class="idc-editor-panel idc-upload-panel" id="idcMediaPanel" hidden><div class="idc-detail-section-title"><i class="fas fa-pen-to-square"></i><span>Update card documents</span><span class="idc-panel-badge">Required for printing</span></div><p class="idc-editor-help">Add a clear passport photo and handwritten signature. You can replace either document without changing the other.</p><form id="idcMediaForm" enctype="multipart/form-data"><input type="hidden" name="student_id" id="idcMediaStudent"><div class="idc-upload-grid"><div class="idc-upload-card" data-upload-card="picture"><div class="idc-upload-card-head"><span class="idc-upload-icon"><i class="fas fa-camera"></i></span><span><strong>Profile photo</strong><small>Processed like profile editing</small></span></div><button type="button" class="idc-dropzone" id="idcPictureDrop"><span class="idc-upload-preview" id="idcPicturePreview"><i class="fas fa-cloud-arrow-up"></i></span><span class="idc-drop-title">Choose a photo</span><span class="idc-drop-hint">It will be cleaned and prepared automatically</span><span class="idc-file-name" id="idcPictureName">No file selected</span></button><div class="idc-photo-processing" id="idcPictureStatus" role="status"></div><input type="file" name="picture" id="idcPictureInput" accept="image/jpeg,image/png" hidden></div><div class="idc-upload-card" data-upload-card="signature"><div class="idc-upload-card-head"><span class="idc-upload-icon signature"><i class="fas fa-signature"></i></span><span><strong>Student signature</strong><small>Sign inside the box with a finger or mouse</small></span></div><div class="idc-signature-canvas-wrap"><canvas id="idcSignatureCanvas" class="idc-signature-canvas" width="800" height="300" aria-label="Signature drawing area"></canvas><div class="idc-signature-toolbar"><button type="button" class="idc-btn" id="idcSignatureClear"><i class="fas fa-eraser"></i> Clear</button></div></div><label class="idc-upload-note" style="margin:9px 0 0;cursor:pointer" for="idcSignatureInput"><i class="fas fa-file-arrow-up"></i><span>Or upload a signature image</span></label><input type="file" name="signiture" id="idcSignatureInput" accept="image/jpeg,image/png" hidden><span class="idc-file-name" id="idcSignatureName">Draw a signature or choose an image</span></div></div><div class="idc-upload-note"><i class="fas fa-circle-info"></i><span>Use images under 5 MB. The existing document remains unchanged when its replacement is left empty.</span></div><button class="idc-btn primary idc-upload-save" type="submit" id="idcMediaSave"><i class="fas fa-cloud-arrow-up"></i> Save card documents</button></form></div><div class="idc-editor-panel" id="idcIssuePanel" hidden><div class="idc-detail-section-title"><i class="fas fa-triangle-exclamation"></i><span>Record an ID-card issue</span></div><p class="idc-editor-help">Describe the correction needed. Generation stays blocked until the issue is resolved.</p><form id="idcIssueForm"><input type="hidden" name="student_id" id="idcIssueStudent"><input type="hidden" name="session" id="idcIssueSession"><textarea name="description" id="idcIssueDescription" rows="3" maxlength="2000" placeholder="Example: Replace the photo; it is not clear enough for printing." required></textarea><button class="idc-btn danger" type="submit" id="idcIssueSave"><i class="fas fa-flag"></i> Mark as issue</button></form><button type="button" class="idc-btn soft" id="idcIssueResolve" hidden><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Resolve current issue</button></div><footer class="idc-modal-footer"><button type="button" class="idc-btn primary" data-close-idc><i class="fas fa-check mr-1"></i> Done</button></footer></section></div>
